      "publishedAt": "2015-11-05T16:48:00.000Z",
      "channelId": "UCsKxZqrZbV5R9EhHK8-aBzw",
      "title": "Rachel Andrew – Flexible boxes and Grids: the future of CSS Layout – Falsy Values 2015",
      "description": "http://falsyvalues.com/\n\nEver since we moved away from using tables for layout, we’ve been hacking around floats and positioning to achieve layout on the web. These methods are flawed and complex, making simple things hard to achieve. Flexbox and CSS Grid Layout give us layout mechanisms signed for the sort of things we build on the web. In this talk I’ll take a look at both, showing the problems they each solve and how they work together to create a new paradigm for layout on the web.",
