      "channelId": "UCsKxZqrZbV5R9EhHK8-aBzw",
      "title": "Marijn Haverbeke – Salvaging contentEditable: Building a Robust Rich Text Editor – Falsy Values 2015",
      "description": "http://falsyvalues.com/\n\nWeb-based WYSIWYG editors are notorious for spitting out a distasteful HTML soup. In this talk I’ll show how I implemented an editor that, instead of trying to filter and clean this soup, takes control away from the browser’s contentEditable implementation, and reinterpret user actions as operations on its own semantic document model.",
