    "snippet": {
      "publishedAt": "2015-11-04T07:35:28.000Z",
      "channelId": "UCsKxZqrZbV5R9EhHK8-aBzw",
      "title": "Julian Krispel-Samsel – Your code will explode – Falsy Values 2015",
      "description": "http://falsyvalues.com/\n\nIt’s impossible to write software that doesn’t break. The more complex software gets, the bigger this problem.\nSince JavaScript has become a ‘serious’ programming language, modern web applications have also become more complex and hence more likely to blow up. You want to avoid that and catch bugs before they go live.\nThis talk isn’t about what tools to use to test your code. Instead we’ll be focusing on the concepts of unit testing and how testing will make you a better developer in general.",
